<title>CHINA: TRADING IN YUGANG INT'L SHARES SUSPENDED.</title>
<headline>TRADING IN YUGANG INT'L SHARES SUSPENDED.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Yugang International Ltd was suspended at the company request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Shares of the raw materials, audio-visual and industrial products trading group rose HK$0.25 or 16 percent to close at HK$1.81 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
